<title>USA: Quorum gets new $850 mln credit facility.</title>
<headline>Quorum gets new $850 mln credit facility.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quorum Health Group Inc said Thursday it has replaced its secured $600 million revolving credit facility with a new unsecured, five-year term, revolving credit facility of $850 million.</p>
<p>The company said it would use the added capacity to fund acquisitions as they occur and for other general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>On Thursday, Quorum reported third quarter earnings of $0.47 a share, up from $0.40 a share in the 1996 third quarter.</p>
</text>
